flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/targets/] --> B[Pydantic validates project ID and target fields]
    B -->|Invalid| C[Return 422 validation error]
    B -->|Valid| D[Target controller]
    D --> E[Target use case]
    E --> F[Find referenced project]
    F -->|Missing| G[Return 404 project not found]
    F -->|Found| H[Target repository creates target]
    H --> I[(targets table)]
    I --> J[Return 201 target response]

    K[GET /api/targets/?project_id=ID] --> L{Project ID supplied?}
    L -->|Yes| M[Validate project and list its targets]
    L -->|No| N[List all targets]
    M --> O[Return target collection]
    N --> O

    P["GET, PUT or DELETE /api/targets/{target_id}"] --> Q[Find target]
    Q -->|Missing| R[Return 404]
    Q -->|Found| S[Read, update or delete through repository]

    NOTE[Target creation does not perform scope checking;<br/>scope is enforced by the separate check and scan execution flows]
    NOTE -.-> H
